flowchart TD
    Event["Supported feature-PR bootstrap or deliberate clean start"] --> Initial["No unreconciled bot repairs; initial round 0<br/>Capture initial_head_sha once for origin audit"]
    Initial --> Context
    Resume["Verified prior attempt of SAME workflow<br/>Typed root snapshot, initial_head_sha, ordered entries/check IDs, stack number, round"] --> Context

    subgraph Validation["Full validation: language-neutral repository checks"]
        Context["pr-pipeline.yml: verify ref, github.sha, root and member snapshots<br/>Feature PR to main stays OUTSIDE native repair stack"]
        Context --> Target["Use feature head initially or after landing<br/>Use complete top candidate head while repairs remain unmerged"]
        Target --> Compile["Workflow compilation against root base<br/>Skip compiler work only if immutable workflow diff is empty"]
        Compile -->|Pass| Metadata["Root feature PR metadata policy"]
        Compile -->|Fail| PolicyStop["Human policy correction; repair blocked"]
        Metadata -->|Pass| Lint["Repository lint check"]
        Lint -->|Pass| Build["Repository build check"]
        Build -->|Pass| Tests["Repository tests and coverage policy"]
        Build -->|Pass| Security["Explicit source, dependency, and secret checks"]
        Build -->|Pass| Docs["Always call documentation reviewer for complete feature change<br/>Version-2 decision: not_needed/sufficient pass; missing/uncertain fail"]
        Compile & Metadata & Lint & Build & Tests & Security & Docs --> Green{"All mandatory candidate results successful and current?"}
    end

    Compile & Metadata & Lint & Build & Tests & Security & Docs --> Status["pr-status.yml: add candidate failure labels on feature<br/>Clear ONLY passing actual current-parent checks; labels never authorize"]
    Green -->|No| Budget{"Repairable failure, valid evidence, below 6 calls total?<br/>No unknown bot repairs; never adopt PR-list results"}
    Budget -->|No| Stop["Explicit stop; preserve stacks and branches<br/>Manual handling; no unstack/recreate/rebase/force-push recovery"]
    Budget -->|Yes| Select["Native needs gate result failure selects repair; workflow_call<br/>Consume one call including metadata; labels are not triggers"]
    Select -->|Metadata| Update["Root title/body update and explicit audit comment; no fake file PR<br/>Verify progress with code/base/members and initial baseline unchanged"]
    Select -->|"ALL file repairs including lint"| Publish["pr-repair.lock.yml publishes next separate repair PR only; no direct feature push<br/>First base feature; later base preceding repair"]
    Publish --> Inspect["pr-validate-repair.yml: native identity, bot provenance<br/>Exact snapshots, expected membership/order/trunk, bounded/protected scope"]
    Inspect --> Scoped["Selected gate plus previously green project gates<br/>Other red/unexecuted gates remain unresolved"]
    Scoped -->|Required scoped checks pass| Register["pr-register-repair-stack.yml: controller metadata only<br/>Ordinary at 1; real native stack at 2; append later; NO merge"]
    Register --> Save["Verify native state and persist typed continuation"]
    Update --> Save
    Save --> Dispatch["Bounded explicit dispatch for next exact revision"]
    Dispatch --> Resume

    Green -->|Yes| Pending{"Pending unmerged repairs?"}
    Pending -->|Yes| Guard["pr-land-repair-stack.yml: pin top SHA<br/>Verify EVERY root/member snapshot, check ID, order, stack number, feature target"]
    Guard --> Rules["Feature trunk rules enforced on every layer<br/>Intermediate requirements may block; queues unsupported and blocked"]
    Rules --> Land["Native asynchronous squash landing: whole repair group into feature<br/>Atomic ascending order; same guarded API for single ordinary repair"]
    Land --> Confirm["Bounded polling; verify each merged PR and squash SHA<br/>Verify actual feature head and history"]
    Confirm --> Audit["Comment links initial_head_sha, baseline-to-final compare, EACH PR and squash SHA<br/>Distinguish original vs automated additions; preserve baseline, branches, round"]
    Audit --> Parent["Record verified root transition; never reset budget<br/>Dispatch ALL parent gates on actual updated feature head"]
    Parent --> Resume

    Pending -->|No| Ready["PR Quality / Ready for review<br/>Actual current-parent evidence only; full live snapshot and no pending repairs"]
    Ready --> Handoff["pr-review-dispatcher.yml: keep drafts; human review"]
    Handoff --> Main["Fresh human approval plus required readiness for main<br/>Optional policy-checked auto-merge; queues blocked; no bypass"]
    Context & Inspect & Scoped & Register & Guard & Rules & Confirm & Audit -->|"Changed snapshot, conflict, scope, API/poll, missing evidence/state"| Stop
    External["Human editing or partial external landing"] --> Stop
